  era: "c. 1193\u20131526 \xB7 Section 14 \xB7 Delhi Sultanate \xB7 1206 \u2013 1526"
  title: Sultanate architecture
  text: 'Indo-Islamic architecture introduced the true arch and dome: the Qutub Minar and the Quwwat-ul-Islam mosque, the Alai Darwaza, Tughlaqabad fort and the Lodi tombs. The Qutub complex is a UNESCO World Heritage Site.'
